#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:5
#: 7ba4df3474c6483997d9df47616d6163
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr "ESC 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:9
#: 29cc212f0ff04a3cb446dbec125e230d
msgid ""
"If the ESC has this capability, it allows monitoring and logging of "
"performance data that previously required additional sensors (like power "
"modules and RPM sensors). The detailed data provided by every ESC allows "
"real-time decisions and individual ESC or motor performance tuning and "
"failure analysis. Note that a given ESC may or may not have a specific "
"sensor type's data transmitted via telemetry. It is common for 4 in 1 escs "
"to provide voltage and current sensors but not transmit the data via "
"telemetry, but rather by direct connection to the autopilot. Check the ESC "
"data sheet and connection information for details."
msgstr ""
"如果 ESC 具备数传功能，则可以监测和记录以往需要额外传感器（如电源模块和转速传感器）才能获取的性能数据。每个 ESC "
"提供的详细数据支持实时决策以及对单个 ESC 或电机性能的调参和故障分析。请注意，特定 ESC 可能不会通过数传传输某类传感器数据。4 合 1 ESC "
"通常提供电压和电流传感器，但不通过数传传输，而是通过直接连接到飞控来传输。详情请查阅 ESC 数据手册和连接说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:11
#: 6728d21f807b44789e48d1866710c42e
msgid ""
"Telemetry data may be conveyed to the autopilot either by a separate wire "
"connection to an autopilot's UART RX pin or across the signal wire used to "
"convey motor speed information (Bi-Directional DShot) or CAN messages for "
"CAN based ESCs. For non-CAN ESCs, this capability is available primarily in "
"selected BLHeli ESCs running stock or BlueJay firmware. But it is possible "
"for an ESC not to implement the BLHeli firmware and still provide this "
"capability. Currenly, ArduPilot only supports this for BLHeli/BlueJay "
"telemetry compatible ESCs."
msgstr ""
"数传数据可通过独立导线连接到飞控的 UART RX 引脚、通过用于传递电机转速信息的信号线（双向 DShot）传输，或通过 CAN 总线消息（用于基于 "
"CAN 的 ESC）传输给飞控。对于非 CAN ESC，此功能主要适用于运行原厂或 BlueJay 固件的特定 BLHeli ESC。ESC "
"也可以不使用 BLHeli 固件而仍提供此功能，但目前 ArduPilot 仅支持兼容 BLHeli/BlueJay 数传的 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:13
#: 277aed3c3d014e0c8748c04d05add062
msgid ""
"ESC telemetry of motor RPM is especially useful for controlling the center "
"frequency of harmonic notch filters to control noise. See :ref:`common-esc-"
"telem-based-notch` for more information."
msgstr ""
"ESC 的电机 RPM 数传对于控制谐波陷波滤波器的中心频率以抑制噪声尤为有用。详见 :ref:`common-esc-telem-based-"
"notch`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:15
#: f69de1d0781d48db8ccbb043b9ec02d0
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support the polling of the ESCs for telemetry "
"data via throttle idle messages over the signal line in non DShot protocols."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持在非 DShot 协议中通过信号线上的油门空载消息轮询 ESC 以获取数传数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:18
#: 8abfb55328074102a3c765fb03eaa64b
msgid "Connecting the ESCs Telemetry wire"
msgstr "连接 ESC 数传线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:24
#: 899acb1988f74fb9a5ac4899f89e3c33
msgid ""
"Connect all ESC telemetry wires to a single serial port's RX pin on the "
"autopilot (above diagram uses Serial5 as an example).  A pin or wire for ESC"
" telemetry is pre-soldered on most BLHeli32 ESCs. If the wire isn't pre-"
"soldered you will need to solder it yourself. CubePilot serial port pinsouts"
" can be found :ref:`here <common-thecube-overview>`."
msgstr ""
"将所有 ESC 数传线连接到飞控上单个串口的 RX 引脚（上图以 Serial5 为例）。大多数 BLHeli32 ESC 上已预先焊接了 ESC "
"数传引脚或导线。如果未预先焊接，需要自行焊接。CubePilot 串口引脚定义可在 :ref:`此处 <common-thecube-"
"overview>` 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:26
#: 82aaeb3f60cc4347b746b03be4db080d
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters to enable BLHeli32/AM32 telemetry feedback to "
"the autopilot's serial port:"
msgstr "设置以下参数以启用 BLHeli32/AM32 数传回传到飞控串口："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:28
#: 8ae2ce09feb8486eba5d5ca80ced16e4
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIALx_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 16 (= ESC telemetry) where \"x\" "
"is the autopilot serial port number connected to the ESCs telemetry wire.  "
"The mapping between serial port numbering and UART physical ports for you "
"autopilot should be documented in its description page linked :ref:`here "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIALx_PROTOCOL <SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 16（= ESC 数传），其中 「x」 为连接 ESC "
"数传线的飞控串口编号。您的飞控串口编号与 UART 物理端口之间的对应关系应在其说明页面中有所记录，链接见 :ref:`此处 <common-"
"autopilots>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:30
#: ea0a90f9e1fd4895b941f4197019b045
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_TRATE <SERVO_BLH_TRATE>` defaults to 10 and normally does "
"not need to be changed. this enables telemetry at a 10Hz update rate from "
"the ESC.  If using the :ref:`harmonic notch feature <common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>` this can be raised to 100."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_TRATE <SERVO_BLH_TRATE>` 默认为 10，通常无需更改，表示以 10Hz 的更新速率启用来自 "
"ESC 的数传。如果使用 :ref:`谐波陷波功能 <common-imu-notch-filtering>`，可将其提高至 100。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:32
#: 9c91ce2efcc043819eeff4c9b0175176
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_POLES <SERVO_BLH_POLES>` defaults to 14 which applies to the"
" majority of brushless motors and normally does not need to be changed.  "
"Adjust as required if you're using motors with a pole count other than 14 to"
" calculate true motor shaft RPM from ESC's e-field RPM."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_POLES <SERVO_BLH_POLES>` 默认为 14，适用于大多数无刷电机，通常无需更改。如果使用极数不为 "
"14 的电机，请按需调整，以从 ESC 的电场 RPM 计算真实电机轴 RPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:34
#: 0cddf15e08fa4c8c94a6bf28e4bd6baa
msgid ""
"using the RPM value reported using single wire telemetry for the center "
"frequency adjustment of the :ref:`harmonic notch feature <common-imu-notch-"
"filtering>`  works well, but the responsiveness is slower than using "
"telemetry provided by bi-directional DShot. See next section."
msgstr ""
"使用单线数传报告的 RPM 值来调整 :ref:`谐波陷波功能 <common-imu-notch-filtering>` "
"的中心频率效果良好，但响应速度慢于双向 DShot 提供的数传。参见下一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:39
#: 1fae3e530a5d4aa3a7b8b1b08a3cd1d9
msgid "Bi-directional DShot"
msgstr "双向 DShot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:41
#: 5620d04e948d48d2a24c2dac8ffacf68
msgid ""
"Newer versions of AM32, BLHeli32 (32.7 and higher), and BLHeli_S (16.73 and "
"higher) support returning motor RPM values over the DShot signal line. "
"Supporting bi-directional DShot requires exclusive use of one or more DMA "
"channels and thus not all autopilots support it. Versions that support bi-"
"directional DShot have this stated in their wiki pages, see :ref:`common-"
"autopilots` for your autopilot."
msgstr ""
"较新版本的 AM32、BLHeli32（32.7 及以上）和 BLHeli_S（16.73 及以上）支持通过 DShot 信号线返回电机 RPM "
"值。支持双向 DShot 需要独占一个或多个 DMA 通道，因此并非所有飞控都支持。支持双向 DShot 的版本会在其 Wiki 页面中注明，请参阅 "
":ref:`common-autopilots` 查看您的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:43
#: 6a9e37ebc7844d78ab412bdb0b3e77e3
msgid ""
"Some autopilots with IOMCUs can not only support Dshot on their \"Main\" "
"outputs (see :ref:`common-dshot-escs` for setup and more information), but "
"also bi-directional DShot on their first four outputs. Currently, this is "
"limited only to Pixhawk6X/C autopilots."
msgstr ""
"部分带 IOMCU 的飞控不仅可以在「Main」输出上支持 DShot（设置和更多信息请见 :ref:`common-dshot-"
"escs`），还可以在前四个输出上支持双向 DShot。目前，此功能仅限于 Pixhawk6X/C 飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:46
#: 0a7d679ca57a40f6b24cb76b45eef962
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:48
#: 86fb0464df9e4759817dbeee23ef197f
msgid ""
"First ensure that you have an appropriate version of BLHeli32 or BLHeli_S "
"installed on your ESCs. The majority of ESCs do not come pre-installed with "
"these versions. The official 32.7 version of BLHeli32 supports bi-"
"directional DShot. Official versions of BLHeli_S do not support bi-"
"directional DShot, you will need to either buy a version from `BLHeli_S JESC"
" <https://jflight.net/index.php?route=common/home&language=en-gb>`__ or use "
"`BLHeli_S BlueJay <https://github.com/bird-sanctuary/bluejay/>`__ . If you "
"try and enable bi-directional DShot with the wrong firmware version then "
"unpredictable motor operation can occur. ESC RPM telemetry is especially "
"useful for controlling the center frequencies of harmonic notch noise "
"filters, see :ref:`common-esc-telem-based-notch`"
msgstr ""
"首先确保您的 ESC 上安装了合适版本的 BLHeli32 或 BLHeli_S。大多数 ESC 出厂时并未预装这些版本。BLHeli32 官方 "
"32.7 版本支持双向 DShot。BLHeli_S 官方版本不支持双向 DShot，您需要从 `BLHeli_S JESC "
"<https://jflight.net/index.php?route=common/home&language=en-gb>`__ 购买或使用 "
"`BLHeli_S BlueJay <https://github.com/bird-"
"sanctuary/bluejay/>`__。如果在固件版本不匹配的情况下启用双向 DShot，可能导致电机运行异常。ESC RPM "
"数传对于控制谐波陷波噪声滤波器的中心频率特别有用，详见 :ref:`common-esc-telem-based-notch`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:54
#: 3aa2fc95df944bf4850738b8e805e26c
msgid ""
"Set the following parameters to enable BLHeli32 and BLHeli_S bi-directional "
"DShot:"
msgstr "设置以下参数以启用 BLHeli32 和 BLHeli_S 双向 DShot："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:56
#: 6fb06d88369347a1b53dffa22db37ec2
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_BDMASK <SERVO_BLH_BDMASK>`: a bitmap used to enable "
"BLHeli32, AM32, or BLHeli_S bi-directional DShot support. On autopilots "
"without IOMCU this would normally be set to 15 to indicate four active "
"channels. On autopilots with an IOMCU this can be set to 3840 to indicate "
"four active AUX channels (bi-directional DShot will only work on the AUX "
"outputs)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_BDMASK <SERVO_BLH_BDMASK>`：用于启用 BLHeli32、AM32 或 BLHeli_S 双向 "
"DShot 支持的位图。在不带 IOMCU 的飞控上，通常设置为 15 表示四个活动通道。在带有 IOMCU 的飞控上，可以设置为 3840 "
"表示四个活动 AUX 通道（双向 DShot 仅在 AUX 输出上有效）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:58
#: 178f5b814f42450d97549a399fd3311f
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_POLES <SERVO_BLH_POLES>` defaults to 14 which applies to the"
" majority of brushless motors and normally does not need to be changed. "
"Adjust as required if you're using motors with a pole count other than 14 to"
" calculate true motor shaft RPM from ESC's e-field RPM (small motors might "
"have 12 poles)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_POLES <SERVO_BLH_POLES>` 默认为 14，适用于大多数无刷电机，通常无需更改。如果使用极数不为 "
"14 的电机，请按需调整，以从 ESC 的电场 RPM 计算真实电机轴 RPM（小型电机可能有 12 个磁极）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:60
#: 65be25de6cd5452da0a9c1f74a7cab51
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_ESC<SERVO_DSHOT_ESC>` must be set to the type of Dshot ESC"
" you are using."
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO_DSHOT_ESC<SERVO_DSHOT_ESC>` 必须设置为您所使用的 DShot ESC 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:63
#: 78d0b67ba7b8470784a07b5188874264
msgid "ESC Telemetry Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "ESC 数传日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:65
#: 7f94198752f34c32bd1bfd48eb539f82
msgid ""
"The autopilot requests status information from one ESC at a time, cycling "
"between them. This information is logged to the onboard log's ESCn messages "
"and can be viewed in any :ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-"
"logs>`."
msgstr ""
"飞控依次轮询每个 ESC 的状态信息，并将这些信息记录到机载日志的 ESCn 消息中，可在任何 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:67
#: 55a6837d8ab34bafb5df8f875b18923b
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "RPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:68
#: c9c710e300ae40098141822ec261c3d3
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:69
#: 371ba40ebe2e42838eb09a78216ba5b8
msgid "Current"
msgstr "电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:70
#: 72d73ea4d0c94efbbf1b5bb92ffbe315
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:71
#: c21a9f5dff0a431c8c05ea625773de01
msgid "Total Current"
msgstr "总电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:73
#: 76333695dd23491aaf9c6d9fb8c73e3f
msgid ""
"The RCOU messages are also written to the onboard logs which hold the "
"requested output level sent to the ESCs expressed as a number from 1000 "
"(meaning stopped) to 2000 (meaning full output)."
msgstr "RCOU 消息也会写入机载日志，记录发送给 ESC 的请求输出电平，以 1000（表示停止）到 2000（表示全速输出）的数值表示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:75
#: 807f2db1563e43e28410559d40822c73
msgid ""
"This data can also be viewed in real-time using a ground station.  If using "
"the Mission Planner go to the Flight Data screen's status tab and look for "
"esc1_rpm."
msgstr "这些数据也可通过地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，请进入「飞行数据」界面的「状态」选项卡，查找 esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:83
#: fc57c89dcc60451281ad13b6b6d82bf1
msgid ""
"Sending BLHeli32 telemetry data to the GCS requires the telemetry connection"
" use MAVLink2.  ArduPilot uses MAVLink2 by default on the USB port but if "
"another port is used it may be necessary to set the SERIALx_PROTOCOL "
"parameter to 2 (where \"x\" is the serial port number used for the telemetry"
" connection)."
msgstr ""
"将 BLHeli32 数传数据发送到地面站要求数传连接使用 MAVLink2。ArduPilot 默认在 USB 端口上使用 "
"MAVLink2，但如果使用其他端口，可能需要将 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数设置为 2（其中 「x」 为数传连接所用的串口编号）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:85
#: 59d42337d07e489ebce9dc334df5f185
msgid ""
"In addition, some telemetry values can be displayed on the integrated "
":ref:`on-board OSD <common-osd-overview>`, if your autopilot has one."
msgstr "此外，如果您的飞控配有集成的 :ref:`机载 OSD <common-osd-overview>`，某些数传值也可以在其上显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:87
#: b5d31bfe54874e1c88373a4395563015
msgid ""
"Newer firmware versions (such as BlHeli32 starting at version 32.10, and "
"Bluejay starting at version 0.19) report some of the information above also "
"via bi-directional DShot, using a protocol extension known as `Extended "
"DShot Telemetry <https://github.com/bird-sanctuary/extended-dshot-"
"telemetry>`__. The version 2 of this protocol, EDTv2, also specifies the "
"following information that can be reported by an ESC:"
msgstr ""
"较新的固件版本（如 BlHeli32 从 32.10 版本起，以及 Bluejay 从 0.19 版本起）也通过双向 DShot "
"报告上述部分信息，使用一种称为 `扩展 DShot 数传 <https://github.com/bird-sanctuary/extended-"
"dshot-telemetry>`__ 的协议扩展。该协议的第 2 版 EDTv2 还规定了 ESC 可报告的以下信息："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:89
#: 14488ecaf73541f3a0fb0e1eecb698a7
msgid "Commutation stress"
msgstr "换相应力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:90
#: 3030842f8d26461fab7459bfec3f7d96
msgid "Error events (such as propeller stalls)"
msgstr "错误事件（如螺旋桨失速）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:91
#: 8b98c5a3855d4744a13e406609217425
msgid "Warning events (such as desyncs)"
msgstr "警告事件（如失步）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:92
#: 28d565cddf5645a9b35ca076ec1208fb
msgid "Alert events (such as demagnetization events)"
msgstr "提示事件（如退磁事件）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:94
#: 84786586fe114e338cc6d7206ff243d6
msgid ""
"If an ESC connected via bidirectional DShot supports this extension, this "
"information is automatically sent to the flight controller, where it is "
"logged as EDT2 messages. This information is typically sent on a best-"
"efforts basis, and is intended mainly for post-flight analysis."
msgstr ""
"如果通过双向 DShot 连接的 ESC 支持此扩展，相关信息将自动发送到飞控，并记录为 EDT2 "
"消息。这些信息通常以尽力而为的方式发送，主要用于飞后分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:99
#: 1093e8502bce43988f3fb051c20659a9
msgid "Use as Battery Monitor"
msgstr "用作电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-telemetry.rst:101
#: 38512c67ec3d4a5188d5b244ab207033
msgid ""
"By setting a battery monitor instance to BLHeli32 ESC type (for example "
":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` = 9), all connected BLHeli32 ESCs with "
"connected telemetry wiring to the configured autopilot serial port, will be "
"aggregated as a single source. Normally all the ESC's reported voltages and "
"temperatures reported will be averaged, their currents totaled, and the "
"consumed current accumulated. However, an individual monitor may select "
"which ESC's values will be used, instead of all, by setting (Battery Monitor"
" 3 will used for example here) :ref:`BATT3_ESC_MASK<BATT3_ESC_MASK>` bits "
"for the indexes of which ESC's values will be used. Default is to use all "
"ESCs setup to report power telemetry."
msgstr ""
"通过将某个电池监控实例设置为 BLHeli32 ESC 类型（例如 :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR<BATT2_MONITOR>` = "
"9），所有已连接数传线到配置串口的 BLHeli32 ESC 将被聚合为单一数据源。通常情况下，所有 ESC "
"报告的电压和温度将取平均值，电流汇总，消耗电量累计。但是，单个监控实例可以通过设置（以电池监控 3 "
"为例）:ref:`BATT3_ESC_MASK<BATT3_ESC_MASK>` 中对应 ESC 索引的位来选择使用哪些 ESC "
"的值，而非全部。默认使用所有已配置为报告电源数传的 ESC。"
